{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00048",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 3.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.34,
      "end_seconds": 8.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Okay, you're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.4,
      "end_seconds": 21.42,
      "duration_seconds": 12.02,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a fever. I don't know what's causing it. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.39,
      "end_seconds": 24.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.64,
      "end_seconds": 33.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "For ten days, I'd say. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.54,
      "end_seconds": 35.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Have you found anything that eases it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.08,
      "end_seconds": 40.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Only paracetamol and a cold sponge, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.78,
      "end_seconds": 43.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.65,
      "end_seconds": 57.31,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "It usually comes with body aches. I mean, about body aches, pretty mild, if I'm being honest. Yes, walking around. That makes it worse. I get some relief from paracetamol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.14,
      "end_seconds": 60.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Any a blocked nose as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.32,
      "end_seconds": 62.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Yes, for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.42,
      "end_seconds": 66.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.71,
      "end_seconds": 69.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.95,
      "end_seconds": 73.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any rash, diarrhoea or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.46,
      "end_seconds": 77.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No. None of those, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.75,
      "end_seconds": 81.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Have you had any burning when passing urine or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.42,
      "end_seconds": 84.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.34,
      "end_seconds": 88.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Alright, anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.02,
      "end_seconds": 91.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.16,
      "end_seconds": 106.6,
      "duration_seconds": 14.44,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.38,
      "end_seconds": 110.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Um, I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.7,
      "end_seconds": 114.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.91,
      "end_seconds": 130.75,
      "duration_seconds": 14.84,
      "text": "Okay, so I'm on Seretide inhaler, twice a day. Yeah, I take Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day. So, I'm on Dolo, 650 milligrams, when I get the fever. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.46,
      "end_seconds": 135.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.05,
      "end_seconds": 139.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.01,
      "end_seconds": 143.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.65,
      "end_seconds": 144.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.28,
      "end_seconds": 163.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. So, do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.83,
      "end_seconds": 181.8,
      "duration_seconds": 16.97,
      "text": "Asthma, for about a year. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Diabetes, for nearly five years. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.26,
      "end_seconds": 192.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "Right. Right, so that's your known diabetes. We'll keep that in mind today. Okay, I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.71,
      "end_seconds": 196.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.41,
      "end_seconds": 198.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.49,
      "end_seconds": 208.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.93,
      "end_seconds": 231.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 22, pulse 96, pressure 116 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.69,
      "end_seconds": 232.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.58,
      "end_seconds": 236.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.27,
      "end_seconds": 240.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.17,
      "end_seconds": 244.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.58,
      "end_seconds": 249.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Alright, now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.08,
      "end_seconds": 273.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Your throat looks red at the back, but there's no pus on the tonsils."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.75,
      "end_seconds": 277.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.52,
      "end_seconds": 292.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "The glands in your neck feel a little tender but not big."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.48,
      "end_seconds": 309.97,
      "duration_seconds": 11.49,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.21,
      "end_seconds": 314.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Okay, I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.08,
      "end_seconds": 315.8,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.06,
      "end_seconds": 334.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with a viral illness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.2,
      "end_seconds": 338.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.03,
      "end_seconds": 354.13,
      "duration_seconds": 15.1,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a viral illness is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a fever for ten days, and no rash or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.14,
      "end_seconds": 356.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.79,
      "end_seconds": 361.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.24,
      "end_seconds": 362.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.71,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.56,
      "end_seconds": 377.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'm going to order a flu swab, for fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.29,
      "end_seconds": 380.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.33,
      "end_seconds": 392.54,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for fever. I'd like you to take cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night, for five days. You take it by mouth. It's for blocked nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.07,
      "end_seconds": 396.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.21,
      "end_seconds": 418.34,
      "duration_seconds": 21.13,
      "text": "Stay home, rest, and keep the fluids up. Warm soups and water, anything that goes down easily. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's review you if it's not settling in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 418.83,
      "end_seconds": 422.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 425.56,
      "end_seconds": 430.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "So, can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.78,
      "end_seconds": 441.08,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "So, I take the cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night and come back if it's not settling in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 442.19,
      "end_seconds": 447.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 448.52,
      "end_seconds": 452.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.67,
      "end_seconds": 453.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}